{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5e5318e71261afcb","type":"text","text":"### Timing Sensitivity\n- Is this tied to a launch deadline\n\t- seasonal\n\t- go-live date\n\t- regulatory/compliance\n- Quarter-end / fiscal deadlines\n- Contract commitments\n- Competitive timing","x":1513,"y":4937,"width":376,"height":296},
		{"id":"e508106fdb7d2e36","type":"text","text":"### Downside Exposure\n- Could this break billing/charging\n- Could it block checkout / payment / renewal\n- Could it degrade a paid experience\n- Could it cause refunds, credits or SLA penalties","x":416,"y":5097,"width":341,"height":271},
		{"id":"3e96af2909a90f98","type":"text","text":"### Time-to-impact\n- Immediate\n\t- Prevent imminent churn (outages, billing fixes, service degradations)\n- Near-term\n\t- Removes friction before events\n\t\t- renewals\n- Long-term\n\t- Improve stickiness over time","x":-1554,"y":5119,"width":424,"height":321},
		{"id":"ebf3c5bd035ecea1","type":"text","text":"### Leakage\n\n- Usage not metered correctly\n- Events dropped before billing\n- Incorrect discounts or pricing logic\n- Free access paths unintentionally created","x":943,"y":5167,"width":443,"height":201},
		{"id":"fedeb11dd9a6825c","type":"text","text":"### Measurability & Attribution\n- Can churn be measured before/after\n- Can this feature be isolated as a cause\n- Is there a control group or rollout segmentation","x":-2297,"y":4905,"width":348,"height":317},
		{"id":"0c4c65adc5fdc9bf","type":"text","text":"### Segment Sensitivity\n- Enterprise vs SMB\n- High-value vs low-value customers\n- Long-term vs short-term contracts","x":-904,"y":5007,"width":350,"height":215},
		{"id":"574fc45238c063d4","type":"text","text":"### Churn Reduction\n- Reducing the rate at which paying customers leave","x":-1118,"y":4579,"width":260,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c126fa52bad889a3","type":"text","text":"### Voluntary vs Involuntary Churn\n- Voluntary - Customers chooses to leave\n\t- Missing features\n\t- Poor UX\n\t- Competitor advantage\n\t- Perceived lack of value\n- Involuntary - Customer is lost due to operational failure\n\t- Billing failures\n\t- Auth / access issues\n\t- Outages\n\t- Compliance blocks","x":-1905,"y":4040,"width":553,"height":416},
		{"id":"0f60ba02a8e4f886","type":"text","text":"### Churn Driver Alignment\n- Is the churn driver known and measured?\n- Is this feature directly addressing it or tangentially related?","x":-2434,"y":4563,"width":529,"height":162},
		{"id":"82fbfa710e98c53e","type":"text","text":"## Revenue Impact","x":-166,"y":4614,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"954f20f216a740bf","type":"text","text":"### Revenue","x":564,"y":4614,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3d530842f7792bc9","type":"text","text":"# New Feature","x":-202,"y":-3840,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0d87a48aecc88a74","type":"text","text":"### Value Realization\n- Is the expected revenue/churn impact realistic/predictable?\n- Are the success metrics measurable?\n- Is this a nice-to-have disguised as a must-have?\n- Is there a clear leading indicator that adoption is happening?","x":-1184,"y":-2558,"width":433,"height":274},
		{"id":"1a609d095f80016a","type":"text","text":"### Complexity \n- Number of components/modules touched\n- Refactoring required?\n- New flows, algorithms or business rules?","x":204,"y":-3445,"width":385,"height":194},
		{"id":"9c68aa1f22b6b8e8","type":"text","text":"### Problem Clarity\n- Is the problem well-articulated?\n- Are users actually experiencing this pain?\n- Is the problem widespread or edge-case?","x":-1184,"y":-3348,"width":407,"height":168},
		{"id":"59e6558a276dc53b","type":"text","text":"### User Adoption\n- Does this require behavioral change from users?\n- Does this create friction or require retraining?\n- Does this compete with existing habits?\n- Is the value obvious from day 1?","x":-1445,"y":-3124,"width":465,"height":183},
		{"id":"af86793ec0b92c53","type":"text","text":"### Market / Timing\n- Is this solving the right problem now?\n- Will external constraints block adoption (regulations, seasonality, dependencies)?\n- Are we ahead/behind competitors in a way that affects value?","x":-1877,"y":-2991,"width":403,"height":220},
		{"id":"6383d747fcf1c560","type":"text","text":"### Alignment Risk\n- Does this align with org strategy?\n- Will downstream teams support it?\n- Can sales/marketing champion it?","x":-1675,"y":-2720,"width":420,"height":176},
		{"id":"c71fbc0b6ff6227f","type":"text","text":"### Outcome","x":-777,"y":-2801,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"839d16e2f819fbd9","type":"text","text":"### Assumption Risk\n- Are the user behaviours assumed or validated?\n- Do we have data supporting the need?\n- Is this based on stakeholder intuition vs evidence?","x":-652,"y":-3353,"width":313,"height":259},
		{"id":"07fa5d93c04205a5","type":"text","text":"## Probability","x":-219,"y":-2703,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"aef17d80241d4389","type":"text","text":"### Delivery","x":178,"y":-2733,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"824915f76a425df3","type":"text","text":"### Quality Controls\n- Feature flag exists?\n- A/B Testing available?\n- Rollback is automated/manual?\n- Integration tests?\n- Observability required or existing coverage?\n- Performance impact understood/tested?","x":902,"y":-3445,"width":365,"height":260},
		{"id":"f957740d19e42f99","type":"text","text":"### Novelty\n- New technology/framework/tooling introduced?\n- New infrastructure type?\n- New integration/domain?\n- Pattern or architecture change?","x":1296,"y":-3248,"width":436,"height":244},
		{"id":"a06678172ca3a518","type":"text","text":"### Blast Radius\n- Does it interact with shared/ core services\n- Does it updates shared models/contracts\n- Does it modify data schemas that other teams depend on?\n- Does the system have fan-out effects?\n\t- e.g change one thing = breaks 5 things","x":1267,"y":-2937,"width":392,"height":234},
		{"id":"564843855e18a35c","type":"text","text":"### Requirements & Stability of Scope\n- Requirements changing mid-sprint?\n- Is PM/UX still revising behavior during build?\n- AC's well-defined?\n- Is the domain understood?\n- Has the team built something similar before?","x":974,"y":-2616,"width":385,"height":272},
		{"id":"489ef889351dddae","type":"text","text":"### External Dependencies\n- Another team must deliver something?\n- External vendor / 3rd party API?\n- Shared schema with other teams?\n- SLA or reliability of dependency is questionable?","x":1056,"y":-2284,"width":407,"height":220},
		{"id":"48e55459282f498c","type":"text","text":"### Team Load\n- Team overloaded?\n- Knowledge distributed?\n- High priority firefighting happening alongside?","x":303,"y":-2201,"width":250,"height":275},
		{"id":"ce5cea28e6c99479","type":"text","text":"### Direct Runtime\n- Monthly running costs\n- Annual costs\n- Peak period/low period costs","x":378,"y":-1065,"width":275,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"88041a5a090986db","type":"text","text":"### Failure Cost\n","x":-791,"y":-1033,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"50eeafe52a09617b","type":"text","text":"## Operating Cost","x":-192,"y":-1003,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3a8615195a6099aa","type":"text","text":"## Cost to build?","x":-188,"y":179,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f41f0f10413ace22","type":"text","text":"### Build effort\n- Blended hourly cost\n- Design/Prototyping\n- Building\n- QA/Automation\n- Stakeholders (Product/BA/SRE/Platform)\n- Internal reviews","x":209,"y":581,"width":350,"height":285},
		{"id":"ca8289447cb774e4","type":"text","text":"## Hidden long-term costs\n- Legacy tech?\n- Bypasses foresight & good practices\n- More services to maintain\n- More maintenance\n- Requires rectifying later?","x":1191,"y":-40,"width":373,"height":219},
		{"id":"6ad356e2c87563e2","type":"text","text":"### One-Off Infra  Costs\n- Licenses\n- Cloud resources","x":1191,"y":209,"width":274,"height":190},
		{"id":"a309a15000125a05","type":"text","text":"## Opportunity Cost\n- If the same people did not build this, what else could they have built?","x":1269,"y":439,"width":295,"height":142},
		{"id":"e4596e540fb4f24a","type":"text","text":"## Delays to Velocity\n- Cross-team dependencies\n- Architectural reviews (internal/external)\n- Parallel work conflicts (Roadmap/change freeze/large projects)","x":837,"y":546,"width":354,"height":227},
		{"id":"1e2cc5a77b60ee7d","type":"text","text":"### Expected Gain\n- New revenue stream\n\t- Retention improvements\n\t- upsells of existing plans\n\t- Minor pricing tweaks\n- Upsell / cross-sell\n\t- Move to higher tier (upsell)\n\t- Sell additional products (cross-sell)\n- Retention improvement & Revenue protection\n\t- Reliability / Performance improvements\n\t- Reduce customer effort\n\t- Improved admin, report or self-service\n\t- Removing long-standing pain points\n\t- Compliance failures\n- Price increase enablement\n\t- New premium capabilities\n\t- Enterprise-grade controls\n\t- Performance or scale improvements\n\t- Compliance / Security features customers will pay for\n- Predictability / Stability\n\t- Annual contracts\n\t- Usage smoothing\n\t- Reduced seasonal volatility\n\t- Forecasting accuracy\n- Expansion\n\t- Usage-based pricing\n\t- Seat growth\n\t- Volume-based consumption\n\t- Feature adoption tied to scale","x":1386,"y":3920,"width":567,"height":846},
		{"id":"3cd48910f4ac72a0","type":"text","text":"## Risk / Sensitivity\n- Risk = What can go wrong?\n- Sensitivity = how much that matters?","x":-220,"y":2489,"width":341,"height":146,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3f702a4fff2691f8","type":"text","text":"### Business Impact\n- Revenue Impact\n- Churn Risk\n- Contractual penalties","x":-1115,"y":2173,"width":335,"height":177},
		{"id":"de3e3d3508080bde","type":"text","text":"### User Impact\n- Number of users affected\n- Core vs edge user journeys\n- Frequency of exposure\n\t- How often is this used/experienced","x":-1989,"y":2162,"width":414,"height":200},
		{"id":"68c0d6284d60f3e4","type":"text","text":"### Security & Privacy\n- Authentication\n- Authorization\n- Personal Identifiable Information (PII) exposure\n- Token/session handling\n- Secrets management\n- Auditability gaps","x":1581,"y":1716,"width":447,"height":264},
		{"id":"624e4a052de8b874","type":"text","text":"### Availability / Reliability\n- Increased latency\n- Timeouts\n- Throttling\n- Cascading failures\n- Retry storms","x":1031,"y":1655,"width":356,"height":234},
		{"id":"08fe896f42d29e97","type":"text","text":"### Data Risk\n- Data loss\n- Data corruption\n- Schema incompatibility\n- Backfill / migration errors\n- Idempotency issues","x":581,"y":1600,"width":325,"height":233},
		{"id":"34b9d377b75489bd","type":"text","text":"### Functional Risk\n- Incorrect business logic\n- Edge cases not handled\n- Partial failure / Hidden failures\n- Inconsistent environment","x":62,"y":1728,"width":329,"height":210},
		{"id":"a2aeb4298c46f768","type":"text","text":"### Risk - What can go wrong?","x":706,"y":2502,"width":580,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8742899a1c542c1f","type":"text","text":"### Sensitivity - How much does it matter?","x":-1700,"y":2627,"width":440,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0e87968eb33207e0","type":"text","text":"### Recovery Difficulty\n- Can it be rolled back\n- Can data be repaired\n- Is recovery manual\n- How long to restore","x":-2316,"y":2562,"width":327,"height":201},
		{"id":"1115dc3361dda2f3","type":"text","text":"### Financial\n- Incorrect billing\n- Double charges\n- Revenue leakage\n\t- Usage not recorded\n\t- Charging failures\n\t- Discount logic misapplied\n- Cost explosions (unbounded scaling)","x":121,"y":2882,"width":344,"height":280},
		{"id":"42e009c67bc91790","type":"text","text":"### Reputational / Trust\n- User trust\n- Public incidents\n- Loss of enterprise confidence\n- Brand damage","x":1066,"y":3003,"width":286,"height":199},
		{"id":"10345180511f2543","type":"text","text":"### Compliance / Legal\n- Regulatory obligations\n- Audit trails\n- Data residency\n- Retention policies","x":581,"y":3062,"width":375,"height":280},
		{"id":"01740c6c0e865a96","type":"text","text":"### Blast Radius\n- Single tenant vs all tenants\n- Single region vs global\n- Isolated vs systemic\n\t- one services/workflow vs multiples\n\t- Retries\n\t- Resource exhaustion","x":-1932,"y":2836,"width":344,"height":251},
		{"id":"53f9531989dba019","type":"text","text":"### Detectability\n- Immediate alerts\n- User-reported only\n- Silent data corruption","x":-1284,"y":2942,"width":339,"height":161},
		{"id":"e19e3b8cdd00fbad","type":"text","text":"### Operational\n- On-call load\n\t- 3rd party dependencies\n\t- Manual recovery steps\n\t- Poorly scoped alerts\n\t- Engineer burnout\n\t- Slow to respond\n- Support Complexity\n- Manual processes\n- Knowledge concentration","x":1581,"y":2844,"width":442,"height":318},
		{"id":"6dba14c2458804aa","type":"text","text":"## Customer Experience","x":912,"y":6964,"width":352,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2dcdc2c8dba12f44","type":"text","text":"### Scalability & Resilience\n- How does it impact both?","x":-1679,"y":5940,"width":332,"height":100},
		{"id":"b7ec7c231c6bbc92","type":"text","text":"### Debt reduction\n- Does this simplify products (shared services etc.) or introduce overlapping functionality?","x":-1188,"y":5940,"width":320,"height":158},
		{"id":"e49e345881abaa85","type":"text","text":"### Velocity of Development\n- Introduce reusable tooling?\n- Enforce consistency?\n- Simplify testing and/or deployments?\n- Cross-team delivery? Expected Delays?","x":-2255,"y":6040,"width":360,"height":212},
		{"id":"23d02d39c4d2fe32","type":"text","text":"## Platform","x":-1118,"y":6354,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"36f63b4a8adc64ff","type":"text","text":"### Alignment with tech strategy?","x":-2007,"y":6486,"width":328,"height":63},
		{"id":"5f4479fc531452bd","type":"text","text":"## Team/Org","x":-919,"y":7120,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e9940d749bdff95c","type":"text","text":"### Ops burden\n- New alerts/observability\n- Escalation paths\n- Does it increase incident frequency or duration","x":-1640,"y":6793,"width":313,"height":182},
		{"id":"c7542f994fe80f99","type":"text","text":"### Dependencies\n- Depend on other teams/shared systems/external services\n- Depend on other teams roadmap\n- Ongoing coordination required","x":-1843,"y":7035,"width":306,"height":230},
		{"id":"b5a45624976ae376","type":"text","text":"### Ownership Clarity\n- Who owns\n\t- short-term\n\t- long-term\n- Single or multi team\n\t- code\n\t- infra\n\t- observability\n\t- paltform","x":-343,"y":7261,"width":361,"height":290},
		{"id":"b8934154f4b6cadc","type":"text","text":"### Cognitive Load\n- Does this make a team's estate larger\n- Does it add new complexities\n- New concepts to understand\n- New overheard during incidents","x":-600,"y":7654,"width":294,"height":266},
		{"id":"15790d0d66f794b5","type":"text","text":"### Skillset alignment\n- Do we have right people to build/operate \n- Is it well understood\n- How many people deeply understand","x":-1040,"y":7656,"width":319,"height":264},
		{"id":"aef7789fc24e507c","type":"text","text":"### Human factor\n- Multiple parallel priorities\n- Frequent context switching\n- High on-call load\n- Firefighting culture\n- Requires/Priority change","x":-1679,"y":7428,"width":439,"height":228},
		{"id":"dca8dc2df0dbc566","type":"text","text":"### Downtime\n- Revenue per minute/hour at risk\n- SLA penalties\n- Customer churn impact","x":-1294,"y":-1500,"width":316,"height":183},
		{"id":"52fc6abbbc83af6c","type":"text","text":"### Cost of errors/outages\n- Retries + wasted compute\n- Data corruption handling\n- Recovery operations (engineering hours)","x":-1840,"y":-1317,"width":363,"height":178},
		{"id":"90d3488b79cc7f20","type":"text","text":"### Reputation Impact\n- Could it hurt trust?","x":-1340,"y":-728,"width":250,"height":96},
		{"id":"477343670fc1bd0b","type":"text","text":"### Compliance / regulatory exposure\n- Payments\n- Identity\n- Data subject rights\n- Auditable flows","x":-1878,"y":-1003,"width":401,"height":184},
		{"id":"2983afdb94d2924b","type":"text","text":"### Infrastructure\n- Compute\n- Storage","x":1253,"y":-1520,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"61c64d2143681c51","type":"text","text":"### Networking\n- Data transfer\n- API Gateway\n- VPC\n- Firewall","x":1281,"y":-1245,"width":250,"height":180},
		{"id":"c5ef65772ce390b9","type":"text","text":"### 3rd Party Services\n- Platform fees\n- Usage pricing\n- Licenses","x":1240,"y":-954,"width":263,"height":158},
		{"id":"cd36618eb4fe774d","type":"text","text":"### Scaling Multiplier\n- Expected Queries Per Second (QPS)\n- Growth rate of usage\n- Worst-case surge scenarios","x":946,"y":-720,"width":294,"height":189},
		{"id":"06aedb2b3cdc87f4","type":"text","text":"### Satisfaction & Trust\n- Would users trust this on an important task?\n- Does it increase or decrease confidence?\n- Will this reduce or increase support contact?","x":1720,"y":6863,"width":440,"height":161},
		{"id":"f9d20bb876d8d2be","type":"text","text":"### Performance & Responsiveness\n- Does it fell slower?\n- Is feedback immediate and clear?\n- Are there 'dead' moments?","x":220,"y":7150,"width":380,"height":167},
		{"id":"c234e53eeb201d46","type":"text","text":"### Consistency & Predictability\n- Does it behave the same every time?\n- Are rules obvious?\n- Are there hidden exceptions?","x":1700,"y":7137,"width":404,"height":180},
		{"id":"2dfd672420b9b83b","type":"text","text":"### Core Journey Impact\n- Is this in a core workflow?\n- How often will users hit it?\n- Do users need to change behavior or learn something new?\n- Is the value obvious without docs?","x":520,"y":7436,"width":498,"height":203},
		{"id":"fe9fd71bc93fe5db","type":"text","text":"### Failure & Recovery Experience\n- What does the customer see when it fails?\n- Can they recover without support?\n- Is failure obvious or silent?","x":1240,"y":7436,"width":400,"height":164},
		{"id":"5611565fef56cca2","type":"text","text":"## Impact?","x":-72,"y":6880,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"5"}
	],
